                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congratulations to our very own Pragathi Kasani-Akula from @SouthForsythHS on being selected by the White House as one of this year\u2019s Girls Leading Change Honorees!  Following her mom\u2019s breast cancer diagnosis, she developed a low-cost, less-invasive test to detect triple negative breast cancer early. Her research has been recognized by the Department of Defense at the National Junior Science and Humanities Symposium! \n\nYour service to make our world a better place in healthcare and your passion to raise over $20,000 in funds which was donated to food banks across the country represents the very best of America. I look forward to continuing to celebrate all of your success!",
